# Prospective independent RSM review protocol

Actual role `/root/adversarial_auditor`. This preparation supplies no dataset verdict.
Only this role's new preparation source, handwritten expectations and public design are available.
The earlier backup review read four RSM-named metadata files as opaque bytes for hashes/spans;
it did not parse or execute their private code. Prior work in other tracks, the shared model,
root guidance and shared public design remain correlated exposure. No unseen novelty claim.

1. Wait for separately authorized frozen target-free production views. Before loading them,
   freeze the precise input bytes, runtime, these public/source/config/fixture dependencies and
   retained source archives. Recheck all bindings before imports and after completed execution.
2. Check view key whitelist and exact typed prompt decoding against the visible semantic task.
   Require complete operative task contract before the `Task JSON:` delimiter; no extra private
   metadata in the lead or task. Recursively reversed object fields preserve list order/types.
   Do not obtain outcomes from context names, IDs, prior private solver files or annotations.
3. Fully recompute every result from initial program/history using the frame solver and separate
   recursive trace simulator. Shared grammar validation is a correlated component, so retain
   typed handmade invalid-stage expectations and ordered-history/checkpoint mutation probes.
   Save all exact sample-ID/hash-bound predictions and initial input judgments, including
   ambiguous/malformed input findings, before any candidate target/manifest access. Preserve
   failures and corrections in new source aliases. Do not silently change any first predictions.
4. Freeze input-only diversity/shortcut evidence separately: actual semantic/program/field-view
   counts; status/effect/horizon/frame depth by split and visible mode/history/budget; simple
   majority/lookup rules with held-family unseen-key coverage and fallback disclosure; prompt
   length, scalar signs, option/parameter/token names, positions and joint conditional fits.
   Distinguish intended invalid-X semantics and target-format lengths from accidental input
   leakage. Measure all paths rather than endorsing a feature-free baseline. No training occurs.
5. Inspect three alpha-normalized graph views using actual inputs. Numeric values, renaming,
   histories/cuts/budgets/styles do not establish new source families. Full option structure
   and both coarse shared-primitive views remain distinct gates. Compare authorized target-free
   legacy input bytes later; missing legacy evidence means novelty remains unknown. Current
   handmade feasibility and empty-body boundary fixtures establish no producer graph novelty.
6. Stop after all input predictions, judgments and audit sources/executions are frozen. Wait
   for explicit canonical comparison authorization. Root guidance or other verdicts cannot
   authorize candidate/gold access implicitly.
7. In the separate gold-access stage compare every target/hash/prompt to frozen predictions;
   independently recompute all factual dependencies, active locators, matched typed deltas,
   normalized snapshots, exact suffixes and non-idempotent repeated-effect witnesses. Execute
   relevant tamper mutations. Review metadata/difficulty/utility truth independently of target
   correctness. Strict canonical full-record rehashing requires separately authorized schema
   and documented canonical serialization; the synthetic metadata fixtures here are not releases.
8. Verify whole PENDING candidate/raw manifest/public source byte custody. R2 forbids hashes in
   canonical claims, permits truthful ordered external member hashes, supports either equal
   name/property identifier, legitimate nonmember owners and shared IDs across different names.
   Resolve exact ID+name+ordered-pair lookup once, from actual members/owner coordinates.
   Open manifest diagnostics provide no semantic evidence. Exactly nine claims/row, 25 named
   entries/family and all styles/contexts are cohort gates, not latent family count.
9. Freeze first canonical receipts before broader/guided follow-ups or other reviewers' results.
   Preserve late evidence in new supplemental files. Final structured receipts use actual role
   and exact record hash, explicit ACCEPT/REVISE/REJECT/QUARANTINE, severity/evidence/fix,
   eight requested quality scores and honest confidence/scope. No root/producer approval proxy.

The prospective plan is 12 families, 108 tasks, 216 correlated views, 300 pair entries and 1,944
owner claims, with exposed dev across all four strata. Those are public planned counts, not
observed or accepted counts. Difficulty 2–4 depends on retained arguments, guards, callers and
option/effect dependencies; event count/depth/row count alone is insufficient. No recursion,
rollback, policy discovery, concurrency, generalized recovery, sealed OOD or learning efficacy.
The prototype metadata probes are preparation helpers, not a certified complete corpus checker.
